# Mosquitto password file (committed as a placeholder; the real
# `mosquitto/passwords` is generated locally and gitignored).
#
# Format is `username:bcrypt-hash`, one per line. The hash is created by
# `mosquitto_passwd`. To generate the initial file with the bot and
# corescope users plus any observers:
#
#   docker run --rm -v "$(pwd)/mosquitto/passwords:/passwords" \
#     eclipse-mosquitto:2 mosquitto_passwd -c -b /passwords weatherbot '<bot-password>'
#   docker run --rm -v "$(pwd)/mosquitto/passwords:/passwords" \
#     eclipse-mosquitto:2 mosquitto_passwd    -b /passwords corescope  '<corescope-password>'
#   chmod 600 mosquitto/passwords
#
# Add observers later with `./scripts/add-observer.sh <username>`.
